        <mda:meta type="pos_id">92</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>That place is too hardcore for someone like you. Muggers and murderers at every corner, plagues, diseases, hardcore gangs. Even the terrain is against you: One wrong step and off you go to kiss the ground below. I mean, look, under-classed folks were forced to live there. They sort of... built their own homes on the edges of Core City. That's hardcore, $(#man/sister).&lt;end&gt;</source>
