        <mda:meta type="pos_id">98</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>That's what I'm sayin', $(#man/sister)! That's where all the fun happens in Core City, other than Hardcore City Bar, of course - which is hardcore - and the Gauntlet, which is also hardcore.&lt;end&gt;</source>
